✅ Final Project: Interactive Dashboard on Custom Dataset
Objective:
 Build a full-fledged dashboard on any real-world dataset of your choice.
Dataset:
 Choose any real-world dataset from platforms like Kaggle or Google Dataset Search.
Tasks:
Clean and structure your dataset in Tableau or Excel.
Build multiple charts: Bar, Line, Map, Scatterplot, etc.
Design a fully interactive dashboard using filters and KPI cards.
Add tooltips, annotations, and interactive actions.
Write a short analysis of 3 key insights you found.


Expected Output:
A polished dashboard with multiple views
KPIs, charts, and interactivity
Insight summary in a text/Word file
